# M17 — `source_factual_is_traceable` weakened so every source passes it.
#
# WHAT THE GUARD PROTECTS. FR-02 and PRD §8.1 ("source list and access dates"): anything
# that is not an openly declared invented assumption must be reachable and must carry the
# date it was read. Without it, a source row can assert `kind = 'news_report'` with no uri
# and no retrieved_date — an unverifiable citation that renders exactly like a verifiable
# one. It is also the only part of NFR-10 source integrity that exists in the schema
# today (`source.status` and the archival flag of canon §12.1 item 4 are not built yet),
# so it is carrying that requirement alone.
#
# WHY THIS MUTATION IS WORTH REGISTERING, and the gap it closes. Every one of the ten
# sources in the seeded case is `kind = 'fictional_assumption'`, which is the branch the
# constraint does NOT constrain. So on the seeded data the check is satisfied VACUOUSLY:
# it has never rejected anything, no CTRL block in 0008 and no SEED check in 0009 reads
# it, and before this entry nothing in the repository would have noticed its removal. The
# two probes in the named test are the only place it is made to bite, and this mutation is
# what proves they do.
#
# The replacement is deliberately plausible rather than obviously wrong — `or kind is not
# null` is the shape a careless simplification takes, it keeps the constraint name, it
# keeps a non-trivial-looking predicate, and `kind` is NOT NULL so it admits every row.
#
# WHAT A CAUGHT VERDICT ESTABLISHES. That a vacuously-satisfied constraint is nonetheless
# under test, by probes that reach the branch the seeded data never exercises.
id: M17
title: source_factual_is_traceable rewritten so a non-fictional source needs no uri and no retrieved date
expect: caught
proves: FR-02 / PRD 8.1 source traceability is tested on the branch the seeded case never exercises
expect-test: a non-fictional source without a uri or a retrieved date is rejected, and every seeded source is a dated fictional assumption

file: migrations/0008_scenario_content.sql
count: 1
@@FIND
  constraint source_factual_is_traceable check (
    kind = 'fictional_assumption' or (uri is not null and retrieved_date is not null))
@@REPLACE
  constraint source_factual_is_traceable check (
    kind = 'fictional_assumption' or kind is not null)
@@END
